plan_validation[1]{text,command,expected}:
  "Live Core 2026.7.4 supports all four frontend contracts; version is present, icon and translation resources return nonzero bounded test counts, and themes return the documented default/theme keys.",HASSIO_READONLY=true hassio ws call -T frontend/<contract> --format json-compact,Read-only calls succeed and only redacted shapes/counts are retained
plan_discoveries[1]{ts,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T05:48:47.820Z",codex-root,"Current home-assistant/core frontend schemas define frontend/get_version with no payload, frontend/get_themes with no payload, frontend/get_icons with required category and optional integration list, and frontend/get_translations with required language/category plus optional integration list/config_flow."
plan_steps[6]{id,order,title,status,created_at,updated_at,evidence,completed_at}:
  plan-step-001,1,Capture official schemas and live compatibility,completed,"2026-08-07T05:48:06.073Z","2026-08-07T05:48:48.937Z","Verified current official developer WebSocket documentation, home-assistant/core frontend schemas at current dev head, and privacy-safe live compatibility on Core 2026.7.4 for all four contracts.","2026-08-07T05:48:48.937Z"
  plan-step-002,2,Implement typed bounded frontend discovery,completed,"2026-08-07T05:48:06.073Z","2026-08-07T05:59:10.492Z","Implemented typed frontend version, bounded theme summaries, icon catalogs, and translation catalogs; registration and capability probes are complete.","2026-08-07T05:59:10.492Z"
  plan-step-003,3,Add exact unit coverage and help/output assertions,completed,"2026-08-07T05:48:06.073Z","2026-08-07T05:59:12.105Z","Focused tests cover validation, normalization, sorting, bounds, unexpected shapes, close-on-error, help, and capability probes; full suite passes 1374 tests at exact 100/100/100/100.","2026-08-07T05:59:12.105Z"
  plan-step-004,4,Document agent workflows and capability matrix,completed,"2026-08-07T05:48:06.073Z","2026-08-07T05:59:13.611Z","Updated README and docs/API.md, docs/INDEX.md, docs/AGENT_OPTIMIZATION.md, and docs/LLM_INTEGRATION.md with command contracts, bounds, privacy guidance, and examples.","2026-08-07T05:59:13.611Z"
  plan-step-005,5,Run full local and live read-only acceptance,completed,"2026-08-07T05:48:06.073Z","2026-08-07T05:59:16.196Z","Built node dist/cli.js passed temporary-config live acceptance on Core 2026.7.4; setup wizard, every frontend contract, six output formats, and privacy-safe count/shape assertions passed.","2026-08-07T05:59:16.196Z"
  plan-step-006,6,Converge GitHub checks and review feedback,completed,"2026-08-07T05:48:06.073Z","2026-08-07T06:45:06.667Z","PR #89 merged as a617dbb after all exact-head GitHub checks passed. CodeRabbit reviewed five findings: four were fixed and confirmed, one was withdrawn after repository-layer evidence; all threads resolved and all bot artifacts reacted to and acknowledged. Greptile and Gemini produced no artifacts within two 20-minute windows, and the final CodeRabbit re-review was provider-rate-limited after the required retrigger.","2026-08-07T06:45:06.667Z"
body: "The plan keeps official contract research separate from live compatibility evidence, adds a focused typed command family, validates every formatter and help surface, and carries the exact head through CI and bot review without publishing."
